Mon Oct 12 09:40:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- nazoos-update-label.path/.service: new snapshots get their boot menu
  name at once (zypper from Welcome, Myrlyn, a terminal), not only at
  the next update check; the update itself still renames its pair to
  "Before/After update"
